  "notes": "Atmospheric trap where the kit reads as space rather than as rhythm: `hihat.continuous` is false at 8ths, the kick runs 2–3 hits a bar, and `snare.layerClapOffsetMs` opens to 6–14 ms because the research says the percussion is heavily reverberant. The low end is the record's body — the deepest and cleanest 808 in this batch (`register` [14,29], `distortion: none`, `portamentoMs` up to 400, `glideProb` 0.75), which is the exact inverse of Take a Daytrip's crushed one. Harmony is two-chord beds and slow 8-bar motion, so `harmonicRhythm` is weighted 5:3:1 towards `2_bars_per_chord`, `chordDurationBeats` reaches 16, and `voicing.lowPassed` is set for the dark pad voicings. The melody has a low pitch count and long note values: `densityPerBar` [1,3], `articulation: legato`, `emptyBarBias` 0.25. ⚠ `medium` because the research rates this high-medium; the modal-ambiguity weighting (phrygian at 3, harmonic minor at 2) is my reading of \"occasional modal ambiguity\", which is named without specifics. ⚠ `anticipationProb` raised to 0.15. With `mirror_kick` against a fully locked 808 both parts take every kick, so every bass onset lands exactly on an 808 onset — `coherence.rs` calls that one line played twice rather than two parts locking. The lock is the style and is untouched; the anticipation is what makes them two parts. ⚠ **The countermelody reached only 941 distinct answers in 1000 seeds against a floor of 980**, so it was given range: densityRatio 0.45. A counter is combinatorial in the styles it may pick, its density against the melody, and the phrase length it answers inside — one style over a thin density inside a single phrase length has almost nothing a seed can vary. ⚠ **The countermelody reached 971/1000 distinct answers against a floor of 980**, so its style pool was opened: answer_lick, bell_echo, densityRatio 0.55. ⛔ `counter.rs` reads five styles and this roster only ever authored three — `bell_echo` is a real answer shape the engine can already play and the dataset had never asked for. ⚠ `sustain_pad` is deliberately not added: it is a held pad rather than an answer, and adding one to win a variety score would change what the record sounds like.",
